  "totalBlocks": 105,
  "translatedBlocks": 105,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6fd0f05323b1173",
      "translationZh": "当你需要按用户进行身份验证时，将分析功能嵌入 React 应用程序会引入复杂性。构建连接 Amazon Cognito 与 Amazon Quick Sight 的身份层，让每个人只能看到其角色允许访问的数据，会增加多层复杂性，而大多数教程都跳过了这些内容。借助专用的身份层，你可以为每个嵌入式可视化图表实施细粒度的访问治理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acdbb22e56f758be",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 是 AWS 提供的统一分析服务。它将商业智能、高级分析能力和企业搜索整合到单一服务中。Amazon Quick Sight 是 Amazon Quick 中的商业智能引擎，为应用程序中的嵌入式分析体验提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfe1bd6ef940d30b",
      "translationZh": "本文展示如何通过 Amazon Cognito 进行注册用户身份验证，将单个 Amazon Quick Sight 可视化图表嵌入 React 应用程序。在可视化图表级别进行嵌入，而不是嵌入完整仪表板，可以让你对布局和用户体验进行精细控制。你可以将特定的图表、图形和指标直接集成到应用程序界面中，复用现有仪表板中的可视化图表，而不必为每个使用场景构建独立的仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a713e476797d085d",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案在设计上力求轻量。AWS Lambda 函数可以快速生成限定访问范围的嵌入 URL，并包含首次使用时的用户预配。该解决方案可以使用单个 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈快速部署。每个嵌入 URL 都能在较长时间内保持有效，从而减少会话期间重新进行身份验证带来的阻碍。读完本文后，你将构建出完整的流程：从创建 Cognito 用户，到基于 Lambda 生成 URL，再到可运行的 React 前端，该前端能够呈现单独嵌入的 Quick Sight 可视化图表，并实现按用户进行的访问控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9501e119972b5971",
      "translationZh": "解决方案架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2c8b9144178d773",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案采用四层无服务器架构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4371569d68e2ffa4",
      "translationZh": "前端层由通过 Amazon CloudFront 提供服务的 React 应用程序组成，Amazon CloudFront 从 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 存储桶提供该 React 应用程序的静态文件。AWS WAF 位于 CloudFront 前方，在边缘过滤恶意请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4b7702db56db3ac",
      "translationZh": "身份验证层使用 Amazon Cognito User Pools 处理用户登录，并签发 JSON Web Tokens (JWTs)，这些令牌会在 API 层进行验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cee3924a86f9b591",
      "translationZh": "后端层是一个由 Cognito Authorizer 保护的 Amazon API Gateway 端点，它将经过身份验证的请求路由到 AWS Lambda 函数。此函数代入一个专用的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色，并调用 Amazon Quick Sight GenerateEmbedUrlForRegisteredUser API，为请求的可视化图表生成一个有时效限制的嵌入 URL。在整个过程中，Amazon CloudWatch 会收集 Lambda 函数的日志和指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c17e47bedd1d6d02",
      "translationZh": "分析层就是 Amazon Quick Sight 本身，它通过完全在浏览器中运行的 Embedding SDK，在 React 应用程序内渲染单个可视化图表。必须在 Quick Sight 账户的嵌入允许列表中登记应用程序的 CloudFront 域名。如果没有此条目，浏览器会因跨源限制而阻止嵌入的 iframe，导致可视化图表无法渲染。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc221741636169c",
      "translationZh": "图 1：展示完整请求流程的架构图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c47acc8209bdc5d3",
      "translationZh": "用户同步与基于角色的访问控制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33591b387e2e80ff",
      "translationZh": "每个需要查看嵌入式可视化图表的 Amazon Cognito 用户，也必须作为注册用户存在于 Amazon Quick Sight 中。Lambda 函数会在每次请求嵌入 URL 时处理此同步。当用户通过 Cognito 登录时，React 应用程序会请求一个嵌入 URL。Lambda 函数从经过验证的 JWT 中获取用户的电子邮件地址，并调用 describe_user，检查该用户是否已存在于 Amazon Quick Sight 中。如果 Amazon Quick Sight 未找到该用户，就会抛出 ResourceNotFoundException。随后，函数会调用 register_user，以 READER 身份创建该用户，这是支持可视化图表嵌入的最低权限角色。这种方式会在每个新 Cognito 用户首次访问时，在 Amazon Quick Sight 中为其创建用户，无需人工干预。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5b07c54c6c151685",
      "translationZh": "基于角色的访问控制 (RBAC)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1e8567fa4033155",
      "translationZh": "此解决方案在多个层级实施访问控制，以落实最小权限原则。在任何请求到达 AWS Lambda 之前，API Gateway 都会验证 Cognito JWT 令牌，因此只有经过身份验证的用户才能请求嵌入 URL。随后，Lambda 函数会以 UserRole='READER' 在 Amazon Quick Sight 中注册每个新用户，授予查看嵌入式可视化图表所需的最低权限。不过，仅完成注册并不会授予任何仪表板的访问权限。您可以通过以下两种方式之一处理这一步权限配置。第一种方式是让管理员在用户登录之前，通过 Quick Sight 控制台将目标仪表板共享给新用户，并分配 Viewer 权限。第二种方式是扩展 Lambda 函数，使其在调用 register_user 之后，再调用 update_dashboard_permissions，以便在注册时授予 Viewer 访问权限。这样，用户在首次登录时就能看到可视化图表，无需人工干预。用户获得 Viewer 权限后，嵌入 URL 会通过将访问范围限定为特定的 DashboardId、SheetId 和 VisualId，进一步缩小访问范围。用户只能查看通过父级仪表板的 Viewer 权限明确共享给他们的可视化图表。对于数据级限制，您可以叠加 Quick Sight Row-Level Security，根据用户的用户名或组成员身份，控制每个用户可以看到哪些数据行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d42dec9aa19aac7",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确认您具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb40b276ac0b70ae",
      "translationZh": "一个拥有有效 Amazon Quick Sight 订阅的 AWS 账户，并已将 AWS IAM Identity Center 配置为身份验证方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6767d3c48f1fc26a",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 16 或更高版本、npm，以及 React 开发环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5611c80fd44b8959",
      "translationZh": "一个已发布且至少包含一个可视化图表的 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e64d5fe8e4a9ebd",
      "translationZh": "目标可视化图表的 Dashboard ID、Sheet ID 和 Visual ID（可从 Quick Sight 仪表板中的 Embed visual 窗格获取）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33ea37bcbb92cac9",
      "translationZh": "具备适当的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 权限，以部署 CloudFormation 堆栈、创建 Lambda 函数以及配置 API Gateway。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afb1b1f502346410",
      "translationZh": "此解决方案使用注册用户嵌入方式。你将访问范围限制为你明确共享给已通过身份验证的用户的仪表板和可视化图表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c023bb8de9de4c51",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS Lambda 生成嵌入 URL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bef603d6f1120e6",
      "translationZh": "Lambda 函数是后端的核心。它接收已通过身份验证的用户的电子邮件地址和可视化图表标识符（ dashboard_id , sheet_id , visual_id ）。随后，它确认该用户存在于 Amazon Quick Sight 中，并使用 GenerateEmbedUrlForRegisteredUser API 生成限定访问范围的嵌入 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1037cf4f31c975b",
      "translationZh": "以下片段重点展示了两个关键操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4adc0dcfbdb8a0c",
      "translationZh": "describe_user / register_user 模式会自动将任何新的 Cognito 用户配置为 Amazon Quick Sight 中的 READER。每次请求都会执行此同步，因此首次访问的用户无需人工干预即可完成注册。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c00084eb26d6dc8d",
      "translationZh": "ExperienceConfiguration 使用 DashboardVisual，并可访问特定的 DashboardId、SheetId 和 VisualId。这会生成一个可视化嵌入 URL，而不是完整仪表板的嵌入 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4fa1a4d2bef64112",
      "translationZh": "使用嵌入 SDK 在 React 中渲染可视化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3819a22094af17f6",
      "translationZh": "React 组件从 Lambda 后端获取嵌入 URL，并使用 amazon-quicksight-embedding-sdk 在容器元素内渲染可视化。两个关键的 SDK 调用是 createEmbeddingContext() 和 embedVisual()：前者初始化嵌入上下文，后者将单个可视化（而非完整仪表板）渲染到指定容器中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "01d7e3de0ad90c93",
      "translationZh": "来自你的 UI 的自定义筛选器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c34ed29ef26ab40",
      "translationZh": "嵌入可视化后，你可以将应用现有的筛选控件直接连接到 Amazon Quick Sight 可视化。Quick Sight Embedding SDK 提供运行时方法，可通过编程方式应用、更新、移除和查询筛选器组。UI 中的 React 菜单或日期选择器无需重新加载页面，就能触发嵌入式可视化上的筛选操作。用户与你带有品牌风格的组件交互，而 Quick Sight 则在幕后处理数据和进行渲染。你还可以串联多个筛选器组，通过单个 UI 事件创建复杂的多维度筛选组合。最终得到的分析体验会让人感觉它是应用原生的一部分，而不是被塞进页面的第三方小组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8631c7f21ade9b22",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick Sight Embedding SDK (v2.5.0+) 在嵌入式可视化对象上提供以下运行时筛选方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03637d61abe7b83b",
      "translationZh": "addFilterGroups(filterGroups) – 将一个或多个筛选器组应用于可视化图表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df4e81055cc609a7",
      "translationZh": "updateFilterGroups(filterGroups) – 根据 FilterGroupId 更新现有筛选器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "984e0b2be992e9b2",
      "translationZh": "removeFilterGroups(filterGroupsOrIds) – 根据组 ID 移除筛选器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5eddd7c43e538197",
      "translationZh": "getFilterGroups() – 查询可视化图表的当前筛选状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7827ad6241668d5",
      "translationZh": "以下代码片段展示了 React 菜单的变更处理函数如何将类别筛选器应用于嵌入式可视化图表：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25f0819a78c6dfc",
      "translationZh": "这种模式让你的应用能够掌控筛选用户体验。用户与你的品牌化组件交互，而 Amazon Quick Sight 在后台处理所有数据处理和渲染工作。你可以串联多个筛选器组，创建复杂的多维度筛选组合，所有这些都由你自己的 UI 事件触发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21dfd756b78d35d0",
      "translationZh": "按照以下步骤在你的 AWS 环境中部署并配置该解决方案。你将首先通过 AWS CloudFormation 部署后端基础设施。然后，你将配置 React 前端，并创建你的第一个 Cognito 用户。每一步都以前一步为基础，因此到最后一步时，你的应用会渲染一个实时的 Quick Sight 可视化图表，其范围限定于已通过身份验证的用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6d5698721569d25",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：部署后端基础设施",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7df2f2a76b7df4e",
      "translationZh": "部署 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈以配置所有后端资源。这种方法可确保从一开始就为所有资源配置正确的 IAM 权限和跨服务引用，从而帮助减少手动连接配置错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8babf74c6ba9d54a",
      "translationZh": "运行以下命令以克隆 GitHub 存储库并进入项目目录：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b93f6b62517fc5dd",
      "translationZh": "创建一个新的 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈，并上传本地 GitHub 存储库中的 template.yaml 文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caebc5b31d605ea0",
      "translationZh": "图 2：创建新的 CloudFormation 堆栈并上传模板文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d2599a9b1fdf8f4",
      "translationZh": "部署完成后，选择 Outputs 选项卡。复制 ApiGatewayUrl、UserPoolId、UserPoolClientId、CloudFrontDomainName 和 S3BucketName 的值。后续步骤中将使用这些信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7cab100268234af",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：配置前端环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b926aa3749dea28",
      "translationZh": "获取 Amazon Quick Sight 可视化标识符",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ddce5266085dae6",
      "translationZh": "打开已发布的 Amazon Quick Sight 仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ffd62dcf77291e0b",
      "translationZh": "选择要在前端应用程序中显示的可视化图表。打开该图表右上角的三点菜单（⋮），然后从上下文菜单中选择“嵌入可视化图表”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff0124707cd25e69",
      "translationZh": "图 3：上下文菜单，显示所选可视化图表的嵌入选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "030158f430fe31b7",
      "translationZh": "在右侧打开的“嵌入可视化图表”面板中，记下“开发者 ID”下列出的以下 ID：仪表板 ID、工作表 ID、可视化图表 ID。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bf1a8f5e394cc62",
      "translationZh": "图 4：“嵌入可视化图表”面板，显示开发者 ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a51b459209135a31",
      "translationZh": "配置本地 React 环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "373d95c7f3e94dac",
      "translationZh": "要设置本地 React 环境并将其连接到 AWS 资源，请在本地 GitHub 仓库的 my-app/ 文件夹中创建一个 .env 文件。在该文件中填入：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6afa478b18bad4bd",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Cognito 池信息（步骤 1 中 CloudFormation 堆栈“输出”选项卡中的用户池 ID 和应用客户端 ID）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6047eef2bcc3104",
      "translationZh": "Amazon API Gateway 端点（来自步骤 1 中 CloudFormation 堆栈的“输出”选项卡）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f81c4ccc48feb5ba",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 可视化对象 ID（即你在本步骤前面从“嵌入可视化对象”窗格中获取的 DashboardId、SheetId 和 VisualId）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc907076a719c0c3",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了 .env 文件中必需的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a76298764ef81f7a",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：设置用户身份验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43ea7f5181a1d70a",
      "translationZh": "要让经过身份验证的用户访问嵌入式 Amazon Quick 可视化对象，请先在 Amazon Cognito 中创建用户：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6164cb258779ae6e",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Cognito 控制台中，导航到“用户池”，然后选择与 UserPoolId（来自 AWS CloudFormation 输出）匹配的用户池。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "85de742b94a69b93",
      "translationZh": "向用户池添加用户。你有两种选择：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43f0834095de2a95",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Cognito 中，使用电子邮件地址和临时密码手动创建用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "85c39c49272ae212",
      "translationZh": "通过在 my-app/src/auth/AuthWrapper.jsx 文件中设置 hideSignUp=false，在 UI 中开启自助注册。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f60688bdd398a6ad",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：构建并部署 React 前端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "08fe44d9b005d495",
      "translationZh": "安装依赖项并构建项目",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea6e9669209e73d3",
      "translationZh": "在 React 应用程序目录下运行以下命令，以生成经过优化的生产环境文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "255310e90abc8b97",
      "translationZh": "将构建文件上传到 Amazon S3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7dc375c082bc5ff1",
      "translationZh": "将 my-app/dist/ 目录中的所有文件上传到由 AWS CloudFormation 配置的 Amazon S3 存储桶。不要上传该目录本身。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a57d577d6d98bd4",
      "translationZh": "创建 Amazon CloudFront 缓存失效请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91d333798201bda1",
      "translationZh": "打开 CloudFront 控制台并选择你的分配。选择 Invalidations 选项卡，然后选择 Create invalidation。在对象路径中输入 /* 并提交请求。这会清除所有缓存内容，使 CloudFront 从 S3 提供你的 React 应用程序的最新版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5627e3fbd758dc97",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：配置 Amazon Quick 允许列表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c2a8b7cf0f89a65",
      "translationZh": "将 Amazon CloudFront 域名添加到 Amazon Quick 允许列表：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "47122d30b6888477",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 控制台中，选择右上角的账户名称，然后从菜单中打开“管理账户”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43654ae83063dae9",
      "translationZh": "图 5：在 Amazon Quick 控制台中管理账户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22781d23928a8bf0",
      "translationZh": "在左侧导航面板的“安全”下，选择“管理域名”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac723403261b4292",
      "translationZh": "在“域名”字段中，输入您的 Amazon CloudFront 域名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c68369974d5285c",
      "translationZh": "图 6：已将 CloudFront 域名添加到允许列表的“管理域名”页面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f1e230c198cccf6b",
      "translationZh": "步骤 6：访问应用程序并完成用户注册",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40c1bffeef47e628",
      "translationZh": "图 7：在 Amazon Quick 控制台中管理用户，验证自动注册的用户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ff0ee6ad03418b8",
      "translationZh": "用户在 Quick Sight 中创建后，您必须授予其访问包含目标可视化图表的特定仪表板的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "362196dbece38b49",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick Sight 控制台上，选择“仪表板”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e038c6562129711",
      "translationZh": "选择要共享的仪表板的名称，以选中该仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4cff9077c66c313",
      "translationZh": "在仪表板页面的右上角，选择“共享”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b913fbd8d7d2d31",
      "translationZh": "图 8：与已通过身份验证的用户共享仪表板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83863114163dbcfb",
      "translationZh": "在“邀请用户和组访问仪表板”部分，在搜索字段中输入接收者的完整电子邮件地址（此电子邮件地址应与该用户的 Amazon Cognito 登录邮箱完全一致）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2ad92d2e3c2be7e",
      "translationZh": "从电子邮件字段旁边的“权限”菜单中，选择“查看者”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "efe464fdf05827b4",
      "translationZh": "要发送邀请并授予访问权限，请选择“共享”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fba133d05e79991a",
      "translationZh": "图 9：管理权限：向已通过身份验证的用户授予查看者权限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6dc7010191ce910e",
      "translationZh": "每位用户都会收到一封包含仪表板链接的电子邮件。您可以随时通过“共享”菜单修改权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "129bc295e0e7824e",
      "translationZh": "在浏览器中刷新应用程序（或退出登录后重新登录）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7544c5e42925d9f",
      "translationZh": "嵌入的 Quick Sight 可视化内容现在应能在您的 React 应用程序中呈现，并遵循您配置的用户专属访问权限。如果可视化内容成功加载，您的端到端集成就已完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a92ad77e0677b09",
      "translationZh": "嵌入的可视化内容应在您的 React 应用程序中呈现如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3cfbe51a040345e",
      "translationZh": "图 10：嵌入 React Web 应用程序的 Amazon Quick 可视化内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2aa1facec0bb968",
      "translationZh": "为避免持续产生费用，请在完成试验后删除此解决方案创建的资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66bab13802c60192",
      "translationZh": "在 CloudFormation 控制台中，选择 quicksight-embedding-stack 堆栈，然后选择“删除”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d286eefa6e6a82a2",
      "translationZh": "等待堆栈达到 DELETE_COMPLETE 状态。这将移除 API Gateway、Lambda、Cognito User Pool、S3 存储桶和 CloudFront 分配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9d89a8cde985892",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick Sight 控制台中，转到 Manage users，移除由 Lambda 函数自动配置的所有测试用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "161e3579b5d9f454",
      "translationZh": "在 Domains and embedding 下的 Amazon Quick Sight 嵌入允许列表中移除 CloudFront 域名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "199faad2fb7f7100",
      "translationZh": "如果您启用了自助注册，并且测试用户创建了账户，请确认堆栈已成功删除 Cognito User Pool。如果尚未移除，请手动删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "071be2d236e8805f",
      "translationZh": "检查您的 AWS 账户中是否还有剩余资源，并根据需要手动删除。堆栈删除后通常仍会保留的资源包括：CloudWatch 日志组、IAM 角色和策略、S3 存储桶（CloudFormation 无法删除非空存储桶）、由 Lambda 创建的网络接口、AWS Key Management Service (AWS KMS) 密钥（计划在等待期结束后删除，而非立即移除），以及在堆栈之外创建的任何 Quick Sight 资源（已注册用户、数据集、仪表板）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c99cda049f99889",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，您学习了如何使用基于 Cognito 的已注册用户身份验证、READER 角色的 RBAC，以及用于生成嵌入 URL 的无服务器后端，嵌入单个 Amazon Quick Sight 可视化图表。采用这种方法，嵌入的可视化图表会呈现为应用程序的一部分，而不是独立的 BI 工具。嵌入单个可视化图表而非完整仪表板，可以让您精确控制布局、根据上下文安排分析内容的位置，并简化用户操作流程，无需在独立的 BI 工具中导航。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba9cd7739421d0d6",
      "translationZh": "嵌入的可视化图表成功渲染后，可以考虑探索前文“通过您的 UI 设置自定义筛选器”一节中介绍的可选自定义筛选器模式。借助 Quick Sight Embedding SDK 中的运行时筛选 API，您可以使用具有自身品牌风格的 React 组件替换 Quick Sight 内置的筛选控件，将下拉菜单、日期选择器和搜索字段直接连接到嵌入的可视化图表。这是一项独立的增强功能，您可以随时添加，无需修改刚刚构建的核心嵌入架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bb3cb363f4591a7",
      "translationZh": "首先嵌入一个可视化图表，以端到端验证工作流程。确认无误后，添加更多可视化图表，在现有应用程序中构建完整的分析界面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b361c206a9ac2ed",
      "translationZh": "有关嵌入配置、身份验证模式和 SDK 功能的详细指导，请参阅 Amazon Quick Sight Embedding SDK 文档和 Amazon Cognito 开发者指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
